title: Extra Window Memory Injection
id: b1adf04c-025e-4d8f-9c8a-cd9a4d8e9331
status: experimental
description: Detects extra window memory (EWM) injection, where a source process opens explorer.exe or a GUI process with write rights and manipulates window class extra memory (SetWindowLongPtr) to execute shellcode.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/011/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_access
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 10
    TargetImage|endswith: '\\explorer.exe'
    CallTrace|contains: 'SetWindowLong'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SourceImage
  - TargetImage
falsepositives:
  - Rare legitimate GUI hooking
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1055.011
